ent-ZenCrystalHeater = crystal thermal inducer
    .desc = Raises sample temperature at a constant rate. The operator stops it using thermometer readings.
ent-ZenCrystalCooler = crystal cooling unit
    .desc = Lowers sample temperature at a constant rate. Requires coolant and does not replace a stabilizer.
ent-ZenCrystalDischarger = crystal pulse discharger
    .desc = Applies electrical pulses using a rechargeable power cell.
ent-ZenCrystalIrradiator = crystal irradiation unit
    .desc = Applies controlled radiation to a research sample.
ent-ZenCrystalHeaterBoard = crystal thermal inducer machine board
ent-ZenCrystalCoolerBoard = crystal cooling unit machine board
ent-ZenCrystalDischargerBoard = crystal pulse discharger machine board
ent-ZenCrystalIrradiatorBoard = crystal irradiation unit machine board
ent-ZenCrystalHeaterFlatpack = crystal thermal inducer flatpack
ent-ZenCrystalCoolerFlatpack = crystal cooling unit flatpack
ent-ZenCrystalDischargerFlatpack = crystal pulse discharger flatpack
ent-ZenCrystalIrradiatorFlatpack = crystal irradiation unit flatpack
ent-ZenCrystalScanner = crystal spectrometer
    .desc = Determines the next cultivation intervention and uploads the task to the laboratory terminal.
ent-ZenCrystalScraper = crystal sample scraper
    .desc = Removes unstable deposits from an open cultivation chamber.
ent-ZenCrystalStabilizer = resonance stabilizer ampoule
    .desc = A single-use reagent for suppressing instability in an open chamber.
ent-ZenCrystalCoolantCartridge = crystal coolant cartridge
    .desc = A replaceable coolant reservoir, consumed by a running cooling unit.
ent-ZenCrystalDeposit = inert crystal deposits
    .desc = Spent material removed from a sample. Cannot be researched again.
ent-ZenCrystalLaboratoryKit = crystal laboratory equipment kit
    .desc = Four apparatus flatpacks, a spectrometer, chisel, scraper, multitool, power cells and initial consumables.

